r the land have you slayed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":160.04,"end":160.98,"text":"Blast away","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":160.98,"end":161.44,"text":"Blast away","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":161.44,"end":162.04,"text":"Don't be like Lancel0t","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":162.04,"end":162.7,"text":"You are the new upgrade","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":162.7,"end":164.19,"text":"I appriciate your thoughts","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":164.19,"end":166.65,"text":"But you've given me too much to tolerate","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":166.65,"end":167.54,"text":"I've done so much for you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":167.54,"end":169.21,"text":"But you treat me this way","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":169.21,"end":172.43,"text":"No forgiveness for this endless love","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":172.43,"end":175.16,"text":"My goddess never looked at me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":175.16,"end":178.25,"text":"Finally our wounds closed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":178.25,"end":180.45,"text":"Our wounds closed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":180.45,"end":182.2,"text":"Turned into","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":182.2,"end":184.96,"text":"Purple scabs","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":184.96,"end":198.0,"text":"Kiss me tenderly gently violently","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":198.0,"end":202.39,"text":"There's no undo and there's no repeat","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":202.39,"end":206.86,"text":"Can't go back to how we used to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":206.86,"end":211.07999999999998,"text":"There's no restart but only proceed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"